  "body": "### Major update\n\n- Support split view for ssh/sftp (#3806)\n\n### New features/Updates\n\n- Improve tab UI, make active tab more obvious\n- Support set custom terminal log path (#3805)\n- Show server sync data status in sync form, including sync time, version and device name\n- Allow clear for bookmark search\n\n\n### Code refactoring and improvements\n\n- Code refractor: Remove use of lodash.find\n- Code split for batch op component\n- Improve font family select UI\n- Remove splash screen to increase loading speed\n\n### Bug fixes\n\n- #3808 Fix some ssh2 signature issue\n- Fix telnet session UI\n- #3801 Fix editor can not select all issue\n\n\n### Other changes\n\n- Upgrade nanoid version\n- Add split view config test\n- Add tab reload context menu test\n- Sync data now would add device name to status\n\n-----\n\n### 重大更新\n\n- 支持ssh/sftp的分屏视图 (#3806)\n\n### 新功能/更新\n\n- 改进标签页UI，使活动标签更加明显\n- 支持设置自定义终端日志路径 (#3805)\n- 在同步表单中显示服务器同步数据状态，包括同步时间、版本和设备名称\n- 允许清除书签搜索\n\n### 代码重构和改进\n\n- 代码重构：移除lodash.find的使用\n- 批处理操作组件代码拆分\n- 改进字体族选择UI\n- 移除启动屏幕以提高加载速度\n\n### 错误修复\n\n- #3808 修复一些ssh2签名问题\n- 修复telnet会话UI\n- #3801 修复编辑器无法全选的问题\n\n### 其他变更\n\n- 升级nanoid版本\n- 添加分屏视图配置测试\n- 添加标签页重载上下文菜单测试\n- 同步数据现在会添加设备名称到状态",
